Description: Claude Code CLI for iOS - AI-powered coding assistant
 Run Claude Code natively on your jailbroken iPhone. CLI-only package -
 the experimental home-screen app launcher has been removed since it was
 just a broken NewTerm URL-scheme shim with no functionality of its own.
 Ships Claude Code 2.1.112 with plugin/marketplace/agent support - the
 newest release still distributed as a portable cli.js runnable under a
 generic Node.js; 2.1.113+ switched to a compiled native binary per
 platform with no iOS target, so they cannot run here at all. Includes
 Node.js 18.20.4 runtime with iOS-optimized V8 flags and uses the system
 ripgrep package for code search instead of a bundled macOS binary.
 Login and authentication are handled entirely by the official Claude Code
 CLI itself (`claude` -> /login, or `claude setup-token` for headless SSH
 sessions) - this package no longer ships its own OAuth callback server or
 credential gate.
